# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
# Commit lock files for root stacks (bootstrap/, environments/*); child modules don't need one.
terraform/modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.secrets
**/backend.tfvars
**/backend.*.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/crash.log
**/override.tf
**/*_override.tf

terraform/environments/_archive/

# Secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*-credentials.json

# OS / IDE
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
